# Session transcript artifacts (auto-generated by .claude/hooks/session-journal.sh
# and the memory-heap hooks). These are verbatim tool-call logs of whatever the
# session happened to be doing, which is not always this project's work. Keeping
# them untracked stops unrelated sessions from writing their transcripts into
# aoa's history. Remove these three lines to restore the previous behavior.
.claude/journals/
.claude/memory/daily/
.claude/memory/heaps/
